target/
Cargo.lock

# CI scratch, written into the workspace by the Jenkinsfile: the relative CARGO_HOME (it also holds the registry
# credentials during Publish) and the per-leg target dirs (target-arm64, target-features). Publish runs
# `cargo publish --allow-dirty` in the same workspace, so none of this may ever be packaged.
/.cargo/
/target-*/

# POC-only: model weights fetched by scripts/fetch-model.sh for local dev
# inference (see README "Local Dev Inference (POC)"). Never committed —
# production ships models signed in the OS image (invariant #2), this is a
# deliberate developer-machine-only exception. dev-models/catalog.yaml is
# regenerated by the fetch script every run; only the .tmpl is tracked.
dev-models/
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
dist/
build/
